      "url": "https://cer.jlu.edu.cn/info/1086/4130.htm",
      "list_title": "关于开展2021年吉林省“优秀大学生”寻访活动的预通知",
      "list_date": "2021-05-08",
      "response": {
        "url": "https://cer.jlu.edu.cn/info/1086/4130.htm",
        "time": "2026-10-15T19:43:14+08:00",
